all is a game that combines retro shoot'em up and modern roguelite game design. It features intense, colorful and fast-paced gameplay, the roguelite run-based structure enhances the game with strategy and replay-value as you draft new strategies and combos.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/icewall", "videos": [{"id": 72327, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "RvN6r3dnzOw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RvN6r3dnzOw", "title": "ICEwall Gameplay Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/RvN6r3dnzOw/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}